menu "LAB-05 peak model"

config LAB05_PEAK
    bool "Compile the additive LAB-05 peak model"
    default n
    help
        Default off. The component CMakeLists adds lab05_peak_model.c only
        when this symbol is y. Kconfig depends-on does not keep the .c file
        out of the lifecycle link; the CMake source list does. Firmware
        variant sdkconfig files are not part of the model package.

config LAB05_PEAK_REPLACE
    bool "Select the peak replace control in firmware"
    depends on LAB05_PEAK
    default n
    help
        Reserved for the firmware package. The domain model implements both
        the persistent-root and replace controls without this symbol.

endmenu
